Package: spatiocompo
Title: Bayesian Spatial Compositional Data Modeling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Behnaz", "Pirzamanbin",
           email = "behnaz.pirzamanbin@stat.lu.se",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Johan", "Lindstrom",
           role = "aut"))
Author: Behnaz Pirzamanbin [aut, cre], Johan Lindstrom [aut]
Maintainer: Behnaz Pirzamanbin <behnaz.pirzamanbin@stat.lu.se>
Description: Bayesian spatial compositional data modeling using Gaussian
    Markov Random Fields (GMRF) with Dirichlet likelihood. Implements
    Metropolis-Adjusted Langevin Algorithm (MALA) and Gibbs sampling for
    posterior inference. The package provides tools for analyzing spatially
    referenced compositional data such as land cover proportions, with
    support for covariates and observation weights.
